 "summary": "The new RCLike PSD lemmas (two_mul_norm_apply_le, re_apply_self_nonneg, map_re, posSemidef_map_ofReal_iff and their quadratic-form identities) have no counterpart in Mathlib's PosDef files, TauCeti (including Realify.lean and Analysis/Matrix/PosSemidef.lean), or Physlib, and TauCeti's normSq_le and posSemidef_iff_finite_sum are invoked rather than restated. The complex spin-density results transport the real f1/g1 lemmas through `re` instead of re-proving them, and Mathlib's posSemidef_vecMulVec_self_star, IsHermitian.map/coe_re_apply_self, im_star_dotProduct_mulVec_self and diag_nonneg are used where they apply.",
